# Core Project Rule

Use `docs/ai/project-context.md` as the canonical source of truth.

## Mandatory Constraints

- Keep the website ultra-minimal: white background, plain text, minimal code.
- Prefer static files and simple architecture over abstractions.
- Do not add frameworks or dependencies unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve beginner-friendly language in code comments and docs.
- Keep changes DRY and logically organized.

## Behavioral Guardrails

- Do not over-design UI components.
- Do not add complex animations or decorative effects.
- Do not introduce backend complexity unless requested.

